WEBVTT

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:09.610
No! No! No!

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:14.860
I want the same thing Yuki-chan got!

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:18.410
Yuki-chan...

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.500
How the heck do you remember that?

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.130
I remember quite a bit, though they're all just fragments.

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:29.750
Like how you cried because you had something different in your lunch...

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:32.090
Stop it! Stop it! How embarrassing!

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:33.130
You're burning my hair!

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:34.260
Sorry, Yuki-chan!

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.720
That was horrible, Kana-chan.

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.760
Really sorry.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.680
And please don't mention that anymore.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.480
Then would you buy me that?

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.560
What's "that"?

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.100
That whatever pillow from the other day?

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.230
That's the one!

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:50.940
I might forget about this if you buy it for me for Christmas.

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:51.900
"Might"?

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:54.900
Why don't you wash it?

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:56.740
It's not washable.

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:00.370
And just wiping it off doesn't get the smell out, so no.

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:02.080
Really...

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:04.200
How do you know all that?

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:07.420
Have you tried it before?

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:09.840
I saw it on TV...

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.090
Yuki-chan.

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:13.460
I'm sorry.

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:14.920
It was my third one.

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:21.100
That's why you wanted to borrow my allowance.

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:22.970
I see.

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:25.140
No wonder you run out of money.

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:27.770
Then your boobs...

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:30.810
Sorry mine are smaller than yours.

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:32.980
You can have my poochy tummy.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:34.610
I don't want that.

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:36.110
Jeez.

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:42.280
It's much better to get something that signifies the two of us for Christmas.

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:47.960
But the last few years you keep asking for boobs and other silly stuff.

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:54.340
I don't care what it is as long as it comes from you.

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:58.130
I won't whine if it doesn't match what you get.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:00.680
Yuki-chan...

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:03.220
What are you eating?

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:06.640
The source of your poochy tummy!

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:08.730
I bought that as an after bath dessert!

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:09.810
I ate it for your sake!

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:11.270
Take this! Take this!

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:12.690
It's hard to find those now!

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:13.320
My Maru-Maru...

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:29.460
What are some things you really want?

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:31.000
Things I want?

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.000
Let's see...

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:33.750
Oh yeah!

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:40.090
That set of twenty-one bottle cap figures with the storage box that we saw in that convenience store!

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:41.340
What's that?

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:43.300
That's what I want.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:46.470
You should start asking for something other than toys, Kana-chan.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:48.680
Oh please, Yuki-chan.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:53.310
The design and construction is useful for my art study;

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:55.690
I'm not using them to relax or for entertainment.

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:57.190
Senpai...

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:59.190
What are you doing there, Saku-chan?

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:01.150
Oh, Kanade-senpai!

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:02.570
I didn't know you were there.

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:04.280
That's total BS.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:07.200
And don't use that angle.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.370
Saku-chan, you're getting your uniform dirty.

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:11.580
You're pointing out the wrong thing, Yuki-chan.

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:13.750
It's okay. I do this every day anyway.

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:14.540
Every day?!

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:14.880
Really.

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:15.340
Wait a sec...

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:17.210
Then that's okay.

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:17.750
What's okay?

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:19.420
Anyway...

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.430
That's expensive looking paper.

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:24.470
A Christmas party?

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:25.220
Yes!

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.640
Please come with Yukino-senpai.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.930
Is it on the 24th or the 25th?

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:34.440
I wanted to do it on the 24th, but it's on the 25th because of family scheduling.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:37.110
I'll delete the data I collected earlier if you come.

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:41.780
You're such a sly woman, Kamiyama.

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:43.950
Don't flatter me.

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:47.330
Kana-chan, the 25th is the day we're flying home.

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:48.870
Right.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:50.410
Sorry, Saku-chan.

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:55.170
Since school ends on the 24th, we're planning to fly home on the 25th.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:58.500
So I don't think we can come to the party.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:03:59.960
I see.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:02.840
That's too bad, but I understand.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:04.510
You have to fly all the way to Hokkaido.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:07.430
Hey, how did you know?

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:09.510
Yukino-senpai told me all about it.

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:13.440
That smooth custard pudding was delicious, Saku-chan...

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.770
I thought that might be it.

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:19.980
You sure don't learn, do you?

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:23.240
So anyway, Saku-chan, would you delete...

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.450
She's quick to run!

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:28.740
And my strawberry milk is gone too!

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:34.870
Kana-chan, my cheeks still hurt.

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:36.630
Learn your lesson already.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:39.840
But it was the kind they only sell fifty of each day!

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:44.050
The snack of mine you ate is sold in limited quantities too.

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.930
Hey! Kana-chan, Kana-chan!

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:48.260
Here it is! The new dorm!

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:51.270
You always change the subject.

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:55.270
Anyway, it's good that they're building a new one,

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:59.060
but couldn't they build it closer to the school?

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:03.440
The commute won't be any shorter from here.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:09.070
But each room will have a bathroom, so it'll be more convenient.

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:11.990
I wish they built it two years ago.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:15.120
The current one has really small rooms and is way too inconvenient.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:19.960
Like how we can't use the hair dryer because it trips the breaker.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:24.090
But I hope they'll have bunk beds again.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:28.680
We can use one bunk as storage, and have more space that way.

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.600
Yeah.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:35.230
By the way, are you still against wearing socks to bed?

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:38.350
Do you want a foot warmer for Christmas?

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:40.190
I don't want that!

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:42.900
I can't sleep without your feet!

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:45.190
You have to do the job!

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:45.320
Feet! Feet! Your feet!

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:46.610
Stop it.

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:46.860
Feet! Feet! Your feet!

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:47.610
It's gotta be!

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:48.700
Hey.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:49.360
Huh?

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:51.870
Isn't Saku-chan's surname...

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:54.040
It's Kamiyama.

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:56.620
And her dad is...

00:05:56.920 --> 00:06:00.830
She said he's the president of some general contracting company.

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:06.920
The taste of Kanade-senpai!

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:10.300
It's very sweet, Kanade-senpai!

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:12.930
It tastes like strawberry milk!

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:14.720
Well, that's obvious.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:17.890
But, but, it'll be complete soon!

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:19.690
The new home for Senpai and me!

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:24.400
The top floor will be a complete
private area with soundproofing.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:27.240
Oh Senpai, let me wash your back.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.950
Oh please, don't be so bashful.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:33.830
You have such smooth skin.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:34.740
Hehe...

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:37.080
We should submit the roommate request soon.

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.120
Kanade-senpai!

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:40.790
We should submit the roommate request soon.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.710
We should, but...

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:45.210
Kana-chan!

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:46.210
What?

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:47.670
Are you done yet?

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.930
Quiet.

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:53.140
We students in concentrated classes get way more assignments!

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:54.680
Wait a bit longer.

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:56.970
Fine, if you won't play with me...

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:59.100
Today's blog entry...

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:00.890
Yuki-chan.

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:02.900
If you write anything bad...

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:04.770
you know the drill.

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:05.690
What?

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.990
What are you talking about?

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:12.530
Hey, Kana-chan...

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:14.910
Well...

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:18.700
I'll like anything, as long as it's from you.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:21.830
What about you?

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:23.540
Same here.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:34.720
So, we'll shop separately today.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:35.430
Yeah.

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:41.020
Also, I made the flight reservations for the 25th, so please take the money to the travel agency.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.150
Electronic transfer would've been easier.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:44.270
It needs to be done today.

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:47.610
Tomorrow is Sunday, and Monday is too late.

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:49.440
Okay.

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:50.990
Anyway, let's go.

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:51.610
Yeah.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:57.200
They are well made, but the paint jobs are questionable...

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:59.040
They're strangely expensive too.

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:03.460
No, no. I'm here for Yuki-chan's present.

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:09.880
But maybe I can get something for myself too...

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.840
Man, she's on to me.

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:13.840
She's good.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:19.430
Huh? How?

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:23.100
Don't tell me it'll be your fourth one.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:27.110
That's weird!

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:30.280
I wasn't thinking like "they're 10% off today" or anything!

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:30.940
Really!

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:32.240
Honest!

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:35.700
I wasn't buying a present for myself!

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:37.240
Yeah, yeah.

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:39.780
Whatever we're doing...

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:42.660
we're such hopeless sisters.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:43.790
So, Yuki-chan,

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:47.080
should we shop together for our presents?

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:49.250
Let's find something together.

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:27.560
What is it, Kana-chan?

00:10:27.900 --> 00:10:29.270
Check this out!

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:31.400
Look! Look! These earrings!

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:38.320
I've never seen pearl and alexandrite together.

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:41.410
Oh, our birth stones.

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:42.070
That's right.

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:47.160
Yuki-chan, let's get these for our presents.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:50.500
But they're really expensive.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:54.500
So let's pool our money and get one each.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.960
I don't have much on me.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:58.510
What about you?

00:10:58.510 --> 00:10:59.760
This much.

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:02.090
That's not enough.

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:03.800
Nope, not enough.

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:05.600
Too bad.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:07.810
They are beautiful, but we'd better give up.

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:08.560
Kana-ch...

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:10.850
K-Kana-chan?!

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:15.860
T-That's the money for the tickets!

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:16.690
Excuse me.

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:19.490
Please give that to me, Kana-chan!

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:20.110
We'll take...

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:24.780
Yuki-chan...

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.870
Um, sorry.

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:29.700
Are you upset?

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:31.370
I'm just shocked.

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:33.880
You weren't acting like yourself.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:36.040
I'm sorry.

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:38.960
So, what happened?

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:43.260
I've been thinking about something a lot recently.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:49.140
Looking at the plush bears made me think about our old days.

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:54.400
You know, how we used to have matching things.

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:58.160
But eventually that trend stopped.

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:02.700
I know I'm still connected to you emotionally,

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.600
but I just wanted...

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:07.450
some connection through something?

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.040
I don't know how I can explain it.

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:13.790
So when I saw the birth stones, well...

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:16.750
I just had this strong feeling.

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.590
I'm sorry, Kana-chan.

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:28.180
I was thinking that it'd be good for us to be different, including what we have.

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:32.230
I hated being seen as the same just because we're twins.

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:38.520
I should have thought to be seen as the same because we're lovers!

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:39.690
I'm sorry.

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:41.320
Yuki-chan...

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:45.610
But it's still bad that you used the ticket money!

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:46.870
I'm sorry.

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:49.700
What am I going to do...

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:51.240
Why are you opening it today?!

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:53.660
Then, Kana-chan...

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:54.250
What?

00:12:54.530 --> 00:12:57.380
Would you put this one on me?

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:59.290
Then I'll forgive you.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.430
Your breath is tickling me, Kana-chan!

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:08.680
Stay still!

00:13:09.090 --> 00:13:12.970
It's dark, so I can't help it.

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:14.890
There, all done.

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:18.020
What do you think?

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:23.860
It looks beautiful on you.

00:13:24.130 --> 00:13:26.030
Now I'll put one on you.

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:29.660
Y-You bit my ear!

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:30.280
What?

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:31.450
Why?

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:32.950
To disinfect it?

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:35.080
Yeah, right!

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:36.370
Wait!

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:42.590
Don't pull so much!

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:44.460
What did you write on your blog this time?

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:46.090
Ow!

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:52.060
Man, Shi-chan's so harsh.

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:55.680
Anyway, Yuki-chan, what should we do?

00:13:55.680 --> 00:14:01.480
Well, we'll have to tell mom or dad and ask them to deposit some money.

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:02.690
Right...

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:06.320
Dad's fist is gonna hurt so much...

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:09.320
Or we'll sell something of yours to Saku-chan, and...

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:11.280
That's not going to happen.

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:14.580
She really would do that, so I won't let it happen.

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:16.580
Kanade-senpai!

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:18.040
I read that blog entry!

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:22.290
I have a Christmas present to save your day!

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:24.250
Plane tickets?

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.130
Uh...

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:28.930
Why three of them?
